function mmrHelp(){showDialog('Your MMR, explained.',`<p><strong>MMR is your match rating.</strong> You start at 1,200, and your current MMR determines your rank. Every completed ranked match updates it immediately. Friend challenges and tournament encounters are series: drawn hands replay, and MMR changes once at series end.</p><p>A win against an equally rated opponent earns +8 MMR, a loss changes it by −8, and a draw leaves it unchanged. Beating a stronger opponent earns more. Losing to a stronger opponent costs less. A single match changes MMR by at most 16; the minimum is 800.</p><p>The five ranked games are Blackjack, Baccarat, Poker, Mines and Connect Four. Blackjack and Baccarat use a 1,200 table MMR. Poker’s AI and the Mines puzzle benchmark are rated 1,250. Connect Four uses a 1,300 MMR benchmark. Roulette, Memory Pairs, Slide Eight, Lights Out and Codebreaker are unranked and never change MMR. Club points and daily claims do not affect MMR, and all rounds are free.</p><p>Weekly standings start at 1,200 and add match changes from the past seven days. Your lifetime MMR and rank do not reset. Summaries and graphs use up to 100 matches saved on this device.</p><button class="btn gold" data-action="rank-ladder">Explore the rank ladder</button>`);}
function help(){showDialog(`${currentGame().name}, at a glance.`,`<p>${currentGame().help}</p><p><strong>Club progression:</strong> win +40 points; draw +20; practice loss +10. Points are never deducted. Ranks use MMR: a small Elo-style change based on your result and opponent MMR (K=16, floor 800). Ranked games update MMR; all five Unranked games keep it unchanged. Wheel exhibitions award 10 points.</p><p>${['connect4','memory','slide','lights','codebreaker'].includes(currentGame().id)?'Use Tab to choose a control and Enter or Space to play. See the rules above for this game.':currentGame().id==='mines'?'Use Tab and Enter to reveal, F or right-click to flag, and arrow keys to move through hidden cells. Clear every safe cell to win.':currentGame().id==='roulette'?'Highlights are for exploring the layout. They never change a result, award or MMR.':'Cards use a fresh shuffled deck each round. H = Hit, S = Stand in Blackjack. Every control also works with Tab and Enter.'}</p><button class="btn gold" data-action="close-dialog">Find my rhythm</button>`);}
